'''Junior God of Light - Valkyrie''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 232
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Junior God of Light - Valkyrie
|name2 = Junior God of Light - Valkyrie CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Junior God of Light - Valkyrie CC''' at level 10

==Strategy/Usage==
Valkyrie is a downright irrelevant crowd-control unit. With stats similar to [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin/Plane Cat]], an already bad sign, she has worse range and a slightly longer cooldown in exchange for a marginally better [[Knockback|Knockback]] rate. She does poorly against Dark enemies for the same reason Tin Cat does: [[Single Attack]] that's ineffective against groups of enemies, the aggressive nature of Dark enemies (amplified by Valkyrie's low range), the fact that Dark enemies hardly need Knockback as they typically have large stagger counts, and superior alternatives, mainly [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]]. Embarrassingly, Robocat is essentially a direct upgrade to her kit, range, [[Talents]], and all. Her one relevant use is to Knockback [[Dark Otter]]s if other options such as Robocat, Bombercat, and [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] are somehow inaccessible.

